{"articleNo":"3090","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=3090&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"졸업예정자 \"F\" 성적취소 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.01.03","hit":"10210","attachments":[{"name":"성적취소 신청원.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3090&attachNo=2585"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY목각파임B&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011학년도 전기 졸업예정자 성적취소 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011학년도 전기 졸업예정자 성적취소 신청기간을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">신청하시기 바랍니</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">1. 신청 자격 : 2011학년도 전기 졸업예정자(2012년 2월 졸업자)에 한함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 신청 성적 :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 이수한 교과목 중 “F” 성적</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt\">3. 신청 방법 : 학생이 “성적취소 신청원”작성&nbsp; → 해당 “종합학사행정실” 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 신청 기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 1. 11(수) ~ 2012. 1. 13(금)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">결과는&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">2012. 1. 27(금)부터 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">“원스톱서비스-학적부-학적자료조회-성적”에서 확인 가능 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 신청 장소 : 해당 “종합학사행정실”</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 제출 서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 성적취소 신청원 각 1부(첨부물 참조)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2012. 01. 03 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 처&nbsp; 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n&nbsp;\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
